# Preset: cg27a_kra47_pass1 - cg27a_kra46_pass1 on seed 4 + STEP-BY-STEP WRITES and RETRACTION ON CONTRADICTION (model changes), per-type step gate, moved-leaves readout fix.
# Preset: cg27a_kra46_pass1 - cg27a_kra45_pass1 on seed 5, ensemble unbagged + CONTRADICTION WITH THE GATE + the COMBINED ANSWER readout. Readouts only.
